Id: crt002w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_certs
Fix: Renew the certificate now, not when it lapses.
References: openssl-x509(1)

A certificate this server presents expires within 30 days. Renewals
fail for dull reasons (an expired account key, a challenge the web
server no longer answers), so one due this month deserves a look
today: when it lapses, clients that check dates refuse the service.
